# Adarsh Gawande | Full-Stack-Data-Science-Gen-AI-Agentic-Ai

> **Engineering practical solutions across Data Science, Machine Learning, Generative AI, and Agentic AI.**

Welcome to my engineering repository.

This repository is a structured record of my **technical implementations, experiments, projects, problem-solving work, and engineering development** across the modern Data & AI stack.

Rather than treating technologies as isolated tools, I focus on understanding how they work together to build **reliable, useful, and deployable solutions**.

