│
├── projects/
│
└── README.md
```

Each domain will contain focused implementations, experiments, technical documentation, and projects.

---

# 🔬 Engineering Workflow

Every meaningful implementation follows a practical engineering cycle:

```text
Problem
   ↓
Understand
   ↓
Design
   ↓
Implement
   ↓
Test
   ↓
Debug
   ↓
Document
   ↓
Optimize
   ↓
Deploy
```

The objective is to demonstrate **technical understanding through implementation**, not simply collect technology names.

---

# 📁 Implementation Standards

Where applicable, each module or project will contain:

```text
module/
│
├── README.md
├── src/
├── tests/
├── assets/
├── requirements.txt
└── .gitignore
```

Smaller experiments may use a simpler structure when additional files are unnecessary.

Documentation will focus on:

- Problem definition
- Technical approach
- Architecture
- Implementation
- Testing
- Results
- Challenges
- Engineering decisions
- Improvements
- Future extensions

