---

# 📌 Engineering Principles

### Build over theory

Concepts become valuable when they can be translated into working systems.

### Understand the fundamentals

Frameworks change. Strong fundamentals remain useful.

### Document engineering decisions

Good engineering is not only about writing code; it is also about understanding **why a particular approach was chosen**.

### Test and debug

Failures are part of development. Errors, debugging processes, and improvements are valuable technical artifacts.

### Build progressively

```text
Fundamentals
      ↓
Components
      ↓
Systems
      ↓
Applications
      ↓
Production
```

